flowchart TB
  subgraph NORMAL[Default delivery path]
    P[Plan contract<br/>Base SHA · ownership · acceptance]
    D[Dispatch a fresh bounded brief<br/>Selected capable worker · verified SSH]
    W[Worker implements and tests<br/>Lower-cost model when it meets the task]
    C[Close paid session on completion or wait<br/>Return artifact, receipt, and original logs]
    R[Orchestrator reviews and investigates<br/>Diff · logs · exits · process closure]
    I[Serial integration and acceptance<br/>Publish after required review and merge gate]
    P -->|After any requested review| D
    D --> W --> C --> R
    R -->|Required checks pass| I
    R -->|Resolvable fixes: fresh bounded brief| D
  end
  subgraph OPTIONAL[Optional expert advice]
    A[Read-only advisor<br/>Example: Fable 5.2<br/>Critique or diagnose from files and evidence]
    V[Orchestrator validates the advice<br/>ACCEPT · REJECT · DEFER each claim<br/>Revise plan or bounded worker brief]
    U[No answer or LIMIT_REACHED<br/>Report actual reason; ask the user]
    X{User choice}
    A -.->|Written response| V
    A -.->|Unavailable| U
    U --> X
    X -.->|Add credits or wait; retry when resolved| A
  end
  P -.->|Trigger A: user explicitly requests plan review| A
  R -.->|Trigger B: worker AND orchestrator cannot solve or find an approach| A
  V -.->|Orchestrator sends the next brief| D
  X -.->|Continue without the requested review| D
  classDef root fill:#eaf0ff,stroke:#4261b9,color:#172644
  classDef worker fill:#e9f7f4,stroke:#208c80,color:#153e39
  classDef advisor fill:#fff3db,stroke:#ad7420,color:#63430f
  classDef gate fill:#f3edfb,stroke:#8c68b3,color:#423050
  class P,D,R,V root
  class W,C worker
  class A advisor
  class I,U,X gate
